sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Network AI Agent
    participant M as Long Gate MCP
    participant S as SafeWorkspace
    participant L as Local Privacy Worker
    participant R as Raw Data

    A->>M: inspect available safe artifacts
    M->>S: list_safe_files()
    S-->>M: approved artifacts only
    M-->>A: safe file list

    Note over A,M: Raw paths are not part of the MCP surface

    A->>L: analysis plan / requested purpose
    L->>L: route_purpose()
    alt exploration
        L->>R: read locally
        L->>L: synthesize + privacy audit
        L->>L: strip identifiers + egress rescan
        L->>S: stage approved artifact
    else exact statistics
        L->>R: execute locally
        L->>L: suppress small groups + aggregate guard
        L->>S: stage aggregate only
    else unknown purpose
        L-->>A: BLOCK
    end

    A->>M: read_safe_text(relative_path)
    M->>S: resolve within safe root
    S-->>M: approved text artifact
    M-->>A: safe result only
